Here's a self-contained savings goal calculator with compound interest, live results, and a growth chart. You can switch between “how long to reach my goal” and “how much must I save per month.”

:::intelligent-ui-html{v="1"}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
<style>
  :root {
    --viz-text: #e6e6e6;
    --viz-muted: #9aa0a6;
    --viz-panel: #1a1a1a;
    --viz-card: #242424;
    --viz-border: #3a3a3a;
    --viz-accent: #3b82f6;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif;
    background: var(--viz-panel);
    color: var(--viz-text);
    padding: 14px;
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 18px; }
  .modes { display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .modes button {
    flex: 1; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--viz-border);
    background: var(--viz-card); color: var(--viz-text); border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px;
  }
  .modes button.active { background: var(--viz-accent); border-color: var(--viz-accent); color: #fff; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; }
  .field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  .field label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--viz-muted); }
  .field input {
    padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--viz-border);
    background: var(--viz-card); color: var(--viz-text); font-size: 14px;
  }
  .field input:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--viz-accent); }
  .results {
    margin-top: 12px; padding: 12px; border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--viz-card); border: 1px solid var(--viz-border);
  }
  .res-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 4px 0; font-size: 14px; }
  .res-row strong { font-size: 16px; }
  .res-row .label { color: var(--viz-muted); }
  .big { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin: 6px 0; }
  .warn { color: #f59e0b; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 6px; }
  canvas { width: 100%; height: 220px; margin-top: 12px; background: var(--viz-card); border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--viz-border); }
  @media (max-width: 520px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
</head>
