A 3D rotating logo needs custom rendering, so here's a self-contained CSS 3D widget:

:::intelligent-ui-html{v="1"}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<style>
  html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; height: 100%; }
  body {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--viz-text, #e6e6e6);
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .scene {
    perspective: 900px;
    width: 220px; height: 220px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .cube {
    width: 130px; height: 130px;
    position: relative;
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
    animation: spin 9s linear infinite;
  }
  .cube:hover { animation-play-state: paused; }
  .face {
    position: absolute;
    width: 130px; height: 130px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 46px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px;
    border: 1px solid var(--viz-border, rgba(255,255,255,0.18));
    background: var(--viz-card, rgba(255,255,255,0.06));
    color: var(--viz-text, #e6e6e6);
    backface-visibility: visible;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
  }
  .front  { transform: rotateY(0deg)   translateZ(65px); }
  .back   { transform: rotateY(180deg) translateZ(65px); }
  .right  { transform: rotateY(90deg)  translateZ(65px); }
  .left   { transform: rotateY(-90deg) translateZ(65px); }
  .top    { transform: rotateX(90deg)  translateZ(65px); }
  .bottom { transform: rotateX(-90deg) translateZ(65px); }
  .accent { color: var(--viz-accent, #7c5cff); }
  @keyframes spin {
    0%   { transform: rotateX(0deg)   rotateY(0deg); }
    100% { transform: rotateX(360deg) rotateY(360deg); }
  }
  .caption {
    position: absolute; bottom: 18px; left: 0; right: 0;
    text-align: center; font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--viz-muted, #9aa0a6);
  }
  .label {
    position: absolute; top: 16px; left: 0; right: 0;
    text-align: center; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: var(--viz-muted, #9aa0a6); text-transform: uppercase;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="label">3D Logo</div>
  <div class="scene">
    <div class="cube">
      <div class="face front"><span class="accent">G</span></div>
      <div class="face back">U</div>
      <div class="face right">I</div>
      <div class="face left">X</div>
      <div class="face top">★</div>
      <div class="face bottom">∞</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="caption">Hover to pause · Pure CSS 3D</div>
</body>
</html>
:::

Hover over the cube to pause the spin. Swap the face letters for your brand's initials.
